            "title": "Sunstone | Campus Club – Brain Wars Promotional Copywriting",
            "summary": "Brain Wars was a Campus Club promotional initiative by Sunstone. This project&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<figure class=\"post__image post__image--center\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/33/SS-Brain-Wars.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1414\" height=\"2000\" sizes=\"(min-width: 760px) 660px, calc(93.18vw - 30px)\" srcset=\"https://%20kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/33/responsive/SS-Brain-Wars-xs.png 320w ,https://%20kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/33/responsive/SS-Brain-Wars-sm.png 480w ,https://%20kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/33/responsive/SS-Brain-Wars-md.png 768w ,https://%20kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/33/responsive/SS-Brain-Wars-xl.png 1024w\"></figure>\n<div class=\"campus-project\">\n<div class=\"campus-details\">\n<p>Brain Wars was a Campus Club promotional initiative by Sunstone. This project showcases the written communication developed to promote the initiative and engage its student audience.</p>\n<h3>MY CONTRIBUTION</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Copywriting for the Brain Wars promotional creative.</li>\n<li>Developing and refining the written messaging.</li>\n<li>Communicating the initiative through clear, audience-focused promotional copy.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"campus-credit\">My contribution to this project was limited to the writing and copy. Visual design and artwork were handled separately.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "author": {
