        {
            "id": "https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/sunstone-or-campus-club-laptop-offer-brochure/",
            "url": "https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/sunstone-or-campus-club-laptop-offer-brochure/",
            "title": "Sunstone | Campus Club – Laptop Offer Brochure",
            "summary": "Campus Club, a student-focused initiative by Sunstone, created this laptop offer brochure&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--full\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\" data-is-empty=\"false\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/32/gallery/SunStone-CC-Laptop-Brochure_page-0003.jpg\" data-size=\"4267x3200\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/32/gallery/SunStone-CC-Laptop-Brochure_page-0003-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/32/gallery/SunStone-CC-Laptop-Brochure_page-0004.jpg\" data-size=\"4267x3200\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/32/gallery/SunStone-CC-Laptop-Brochure_page-0004-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/32/gallery/SunStone-CC-Laptop-Brochure_page-0002.jpg\" data-size=\"4267x3200\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/32/gallery/SunStone-CC-Laptop-Brochure_page-0002-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/32/gallery/SunStone-CC-Laptop-Brochure_page-0001.jpg\" data-size=\"4267x3200\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/32/gallery/SunStone-CC-Laptop-Brochure_page-0001-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"campus-project\">\n<div class=\"campus-details\">\n<p>Campus Club, a student-focused initiative by Sunstone, created this laptop offer brochure to help college students explore affordable laptop options for their academic and everyday needs.</p>\n<p>The brochure brought together laptop options from Lenovo, Dell and HP, presenting their specifications, pricing and bundled accessories in a clear, student-friendly format.</p>\n<h3>PROJECT APPROACH</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Developed the campaign concept and central communication: “Chase Excellence, Digitally!”</li>\n<li>Shaped the offer messaging around the availability of the latest laptops at accessible prices.</li>\n<li>Structured product information, specifications, pricing and included accessories for easy comparison.</li>\n<li>Maintained a consistent communication approach across the different laptop brands and product options.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>MY CONTRIBUTION</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>End-to-end copywriting and content development for the brochure.</li>\n<li>Concept development and communication strategy.</li>\n<li>Creative direction and briefing of the design team.</li>\n<li>Guiding designers through the visual execution and layout.</li>\n<li>Team coordination and review of the final creative output.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"campus-credit\">I handled the project from concept and written communication through creative direction and team coordination. The visual artwork and layout were executed by the design team under my guidance.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
