        {
            "id": "https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/sunstone-or-campus-club-email-and-mailer-copywriting/",
            "url": "https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/sunstone-or-campus-club-email-and-mailer-copywriting/",
            "title": "Sunstone | Campus Club – Email &amp; Mailer Copywriting",
            "summary": "A collection of email and promotional mailer communications developed for Sunstone's Campus&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--full\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\" data-is-empty=\"false\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/31/gallery/CC-Mailer.png\" data-size=\"600x1572\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/31/gallery/CC-Mailer-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"1572\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/31/gallery/CC-Welcome-Email.png\" data-size=\"615x2786\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/31/gallery/CC-Welcome-Email-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"615\" height=\"2786\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"cc-email-project\">\n<div class=\"cc-email-details\">\n<p>A collection of email and promotional mailer communications developed for Sunstone's Campus Club, a student-focused initiative connecting college students with academic, career and community opportunities.</p>\n<p>I was responsible for developing the written communication and coordinating its creative execution, working closely with the design team to translate the messaging into the final email and mailer creatives.</p>\n<h3>MY ROLE &amp; CONTRIBUTION</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete copywriting for the Campus Club promotional mailer.</li>\n<li>Complete copywriting for the Campus Club welcome email.</li>\n<li>Developing and structuring the messaging for both communications.</li>\n<li>Briefing and guiding the designer on the creative direction and execution.</li>\n<li>Handling and coordinating the team involved in delivering the communication.</li>\n<li>Reviewing the creative execution to ensure the final output aligned with the intended messaging.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"cc-email-credit\">My responsibilities covered copywriting, creative direction and team coordination. The visual artwork and design execution were handled by the design team under my guidance.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "author": {
                "name": "Kartikaya Shiv Omrania"
            },
