        {
            "id": "https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/sunstone-or-rise-career-guidance-initiative/",
            "url": "https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/sunstone-or-rise-career-guidance-initiative/",
            "title": "Sunstone | RISE – Career Guidance Initiative",
            "summary": "Sunstone RISE was a career guidance initiative designed for students from Classes&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--full\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\" data-is-empty=\"false\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/30/gallery/SS-Rise-Mail_page-0001.jpg\" data-size=\"2481x3508\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/30/gallery/SS-Rise-Mail_page-0001-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1086\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/30/gallery/SS-Rise-Mail_page-0002.jpg\" data-size=\"2481x3508\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/30/gallery/SS-Rise-Mail_page-0002-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1086\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"rise-project\">\n<div class=\"rise-details\">\n<p>Sunstone RISE was a career guidance initiative designed for students from Classes 11 and 12, providing structured guidance through academic preparation, career exploration and scholarship opportunities.</p>\n<p>I developed the written communication for the initiative, including its brochure and school outreach email, translating the programme's offerings and four-stage structure into clear, engaging messaging for students and educational institutions.</p>\n<h3>PROGRAMME &amp; BROCHURE COPY</h3>\n<p>Developed the content explaining the four stages of the RISE initiative:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Junior UG Program – An introduction to undergraduate education and what lies ahead.</li>\n<li>Board Exam Prep – Tips, toolkits and expert guidance for board examinations.</li>\n<li>Career Coach – Counselling to help students better understand their career options.</li>\n<li>National Scholarship Test – An opportunity to compete for scholarships worth up to ₹1 crore.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>SCHOOL OUTREACH COMMUNICATION</h3>\n<p>Developed the outreach email introducing Sunstone RISE to schools, explaining the programme's objectives, its educational components and the proposed partnership with institutions.</p>\n<h3>MY CONTRIBUTION</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete copywriting for the RISE brochure.</li>\n<li>Content development and messaging for all four programme stages.</li>\n<li>Writing and structuring programme descriptions and student benefits.</li>\n<li>Copywriting for school outreach and partnership communication.</li>\n<li>Developing clear messaging for students, parents and educational institutions.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"rise-credit\">My contribution covered the written content and copywriting for the brochure and school outreach communication.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "author": {
                "name": "Kartikaya Shiv Omrania"
            },
            "tags": [
                   "Writing &amp; Copywriting"
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-11-01T03:01:23+05:30",
            "date_modified": "2026-11-01T03:02:09+05:30"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/sunstone-or-campus-club-brochure-copywriting-2/",
            "url": "https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/sunstone-or-campus-club-brochure-copywriting-2/",
            "title": "Sunstone | Campus Club – Brochure Copywriting",
            "summary": "View Full Brochure (PDF) Campus Club is a student-focused initiative by Sunstone,&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<figure class=\"post__image post__image--center\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/29/Screenshot-2026-11-01-023650f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"392\" height=\"531\" sizes=\"(min-width: 760px) 660px, calc(93.18vw - 30px)\" srcset=\"https://%20kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/29/responsive/Screenshot-2026-11-01-023650f-xs.png 320w ,https://%20kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/29/responsive/Screenshot-2026-11-01-023650f-sm.png 480w ,https://%20kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/29/responsive/Screenshot-2026-11-01-023650f-md.png 768w ,https://%20kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/29/responsive/Screenshot-2026-11-01-023650f-xl.png 1024w\"></figure>\n<p class=\"align-center\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/files/CC - Brochure.pdf\" title=\"Campus Club: Brochure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View Full Brochure (PDF)</a></p>\n<div class=\"campus-project\">\n<div class=\"campus-details\">\n<p>Campus Club is a student-focused initiative by Sunstone, designed to help college students access academic support, career opportunities, professional development and community experiences.</p>\n<p>I developed the complete written content for the 13-page Campus Club brochure, communicating the initiative's offerings, benefits, programmes and opportunities for students.</p>\n<h3>BROCHURE CONTENT</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>About Us, Campus Club introduction and vision.</li>\n<li>Student benefits and exclusive membership offerings.</li>\n<li>Academic support and educational programmes.</li>\n<li>Community engagement, events and activities.</li>\n<li>Career development, placements and internship opportunities.</li>\n<li>Achievements, placement highlights and student success stories.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>MY CONTRIBUTION</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete copywriting for the 13-page brochure.</li>\n<li>Content development and structuring across all sections.</li>\n<li>Writing programme descriptions, student benefits and promotional messaging.</li>\n<li>Developing clear and engaging communication to present the Campus Club offering.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"campus-credit\">My responsibility was the complete written content and copywriting. The visual design and brochure layout were handled by the design team.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "author": {
                "name": "Kartikaya Shiv Omrania"
            },
            "tags": [
                   "Writing &amp; Copywriting"
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-11-01T02:49:52+05:30",
            "date_modified": "2026-11-01T03:18:04+05:30"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/sunstone-or-campus-club-brainbox-campaign-3/",
            "url": "https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/sunstone-or-campus-club-brainbox-campaign-3/",
            "title": "Sunstone | Campus Club – BrainBox Campaign",
            "summary": "Sunstone | Campus Club – BrainBox Campaign BrainBox was a Campus Club&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\" data-is-empty=\"false\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-BB-Mail-2.png\" data-size=\"1017x521\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-BB-Mail-2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"393\"> </a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-Website-Content-1.png\" data-size=\"1901x662\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-Website-Content-1-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"267\"> </a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-Website-Content-2.png\" data-size=\"1898x527\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-Website-Content-2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"213\"> </a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-Website-Content-3.png\" data-size=\"1896x707\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-Website-Content-3-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"286\"> </a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-Website-Content-4.png\" data-size=\"1896x780\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-Website-Content-4-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"316\"> </a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-Website-Content-5.png\" data-size=\"1048x813\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-Website-Content-5-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"596\"> </a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-BB-Mail-1.png\" data-size=\"1282x470\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/28/gallery/SunStone-BB-Mail-1-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"282\"> </a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"campaign-project\">\n<div class=\"campaign-details\">\n<h2>Sunstone | Campus Club – BrainBox Campaign</h2>\n<p>BrainBox was a Campus Club campaign developed for college students, combining interactive quizzes, daily themes, competitions and prizes. I came up with the BrainBox campaign name and led its content development and execution, working with a team of designers to bring the campaign creatives to life.</p>\n<h3>CAMPAIGN WEBSITE &amp; CONTENT</h3>\n<p>Developed the written content for the BrainBox website, including campaign messaging, introductory content, participation instructions, FAQs and terms and conditions.</p>\n<h3>CAMPAIGN COMMUNICATION</h3>\n<p>Created copy for promotional mailers and campaign communications, including English and Hindi/Hinglish messaging to explain the quiz, participation process, prizes and engagement opportunities.</p>\n<h3>MY ROLE &amp; CONTRIBUTION</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Conceptualisation and naming of the BrainBox campaign.</li>\n<li>Website copywriting and content development.</li>\n<li>Writing promotional copy, mailers, FAQs and campaign communication.</li>\n<li>Developing English and Hindi/Hinglish messaging.</li>\n<li>Leading and coordinating the design team responsible for the campaign's visual creatives.</li>\n<li>Managing campaign execution and coordinating its different creative requirements.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"campaign-credit\">My contribution covered campaign development, copywriting and creative team coordination. Visual artwork and graphic design were executed by the design team.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "author": {
                "name": "Kartikaya Shiv Omrania"
